# Build artifacts
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# User state — never published.
# The authoritative event log (SQLite) also holds the alias<->model map (the blind key);
# publishing it would both leak usage and defeat the blind. Wire archives are local-only too.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
/wire/
*.warc.gz

# Real config and secrets (ship config.example.toml instead)
/config.toml
.env
*.key

# Personal, machine-local agent instructions (referenced by AGENTS.md). Each contributor keeps
# their own local setup here (Nix/jj/editor/etc.); it is never shared. See AGENTS.md.
AGENTS.local.md

# pi coding agent working dir: ignore local state (settings, sessions, auth) but keep the one
# committed, auto-discovered extension that loads AGENTS.local.md into pi. See AGENTS.md.
/.pi/*
!/.pi/extensions/
/.pi/extensions/*
!/.pi/extensions/load-agents-local.ts
